2026-10-26  The author

	* scripts/: first public release. 5,298 AVM1 script records
	recovered from the 2006 SuperSmash.swf with JPEXS Free Flash
	Decompiler 26.4.0 (`-export script`, zero errors, 1m44s).

	* tools/build-singlefile.mjs: single-file browser bundle builder.
	Embeds ruffle.js, both wasm cores (SIMD + baseline) and the game
	as base64; a fetch shim answers Ruffle's wasm requests from
	memory, so the output runs from file:// with no network.

	* docs/NOTES.md: recovery method, fidelity report, the dead
	MochiBot loader found during analysis, and what is NOT here and
	why.

	Sources and tools licensed AGPL-3.0-only. The .swf, its sprites
	and its sounds are deliberately absent; see README and INSTALL.
